     - ✅
     - ✅
   * - v0.4.0
     - ✅
     - ✅
     - ✅
     - ✅
   * - v0.3.0
     - ✅
     - ✅
     - ✅
     - ✅
   * - v0.2.x
     - ✅
     - ✅
     - ✅
     - ✅
   * - v0.1.0
     - ✅
     - ❌
     - ✅
     - ✅

Migration Guides
----------------

For upgrading between versions, see:

- :doc:`/guides/migration_guide_v0_4` — Upgrading from v0.3.0 to v0.4.0
